# beard/stubble: Stubble: a few days of growth, a solid hair-shadow band along the jaw, the chin and either side of the mouth
# (inside the head's own outline: the jaw's shape shows; one pixel of mouth always shows)
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the head box (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
# (polish i1) facing R / L the growth is sparse above the jaw line (hair 2), so the face is never swallowed (the archer)
use person
body man
role beard stubble
layer beard
anchor head
keys rest
tags overlay

view D key rest origin 0 0
